[{"client_msg_id":"bd6dad01-77f8-4925-8c29-56f6acf58758","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"そうなんですよね。。`:redraw` とかしないと駄目っすね。 同期の `:LspDocumentFormatSync` のほうなら少しはだいじょうぶかもdesu。","ts":"1619751397.304400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"4Hn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a315c663-1731-417d-822a-33e72a8dedb3","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"venv にも諸々入れたけど保存時に\n```WARNING: The file has been changed since reading it!!!```\nが出るな。↑の専用のプラグインはちゃんと動きました。なので vim-lsp 使う人は↑がオススメです。","ts":"1619751200.303200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vggKu"}]},{"client_msg_id":"85863a7d-775f-431f-aade-38d8c7a44dd5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"そっちが優先して選ばれる機構があれば別だけど...","ts":"1619749133.302000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=yVvf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc9e5e99-4cb1-4a73-830c-1701b9768df5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"僕が coc のほうで coc-pysen でやったのはインストール時にそれらツールもインストールする方法(pysen-ls-all的な)のと、バージョン指定して各種ツールを入れられるようにしたのと、プロジェクトにあればその pysen-ls を立ち上げるみたいなのはやりました。 \u003chttps://github.com/yaegassy/coc-pysen\u003e\n\n作りましたけど使ってないですw","ts":"1619749132.301900","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: yaegassy/coc-pysen","id":1,"title":"yaegassy/coc-pysen","title_link":"https://github.com/yaegassy/coc-pysen","text":"pysen-ls (pysen language server) extension for coc.nvim. Python linting, formatting made easy. - yaegassy/coc-pysen","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/d15821abfcaa0d7c54040485fd220fcd4453a53cd6c8d50e04fbb08d16eafbb7/yaegassy/coc-pysen","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/yaegassy/coc-pysen","original_url":"https://github.com/yaegassy/coc-pysen"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5nF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4316ff29-c7ee-4fa8-833b-3f24cea8bae0","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"パス指定せずに black 叩いてるから vim-lsp-settings の venv に入れるだけじゃダメなのか。","ts":"1619749086.301200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A73k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c68dad7d-b979-4677-ba89-009a92d60ae7","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/pfnet/pysen/blob/be7666856cf99f07fc77c9d5fc0a9385498505e6/pysen/ext/black_wrapper.py#L85\u003e","ts":"1619749050.300300","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: pfnet/pysen","id":1,"title":"pfnet/pysen","title_link":"https://github.com/pfnet/pysen/blob/be7666856cf99f07fc77c9d5fc0a9385498505e6/pysen/ext/black_wrapper.py#L85","text":"Python linting made easy. Also a casual yet honorific way to address individuals who have entered an organization prior to you. - pfnet/pysen","image_url":"https://opengraph.githubassets.com/33ec1799bc8b19e061d443112fa290b95910b68d3f0ae5a9954f35f7169d2e31/pfnet/pysen","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","from_url":"https://github.com/pfnet/pysen/blob/be7666856cf99f07fc77c9d5fc0a9385498505e6/pysen/ext/black_wrapper.py#L85","original_url":"https://github.com/pfnet/pysen/blob/be7666856cf99f07fc77c9d5fc0a9385498505e6/pysen/ext/black_wrapper.py#L85"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"C=kKm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8e772256-a2d1-4a96-9bcf-116e9fa037c5","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"プロジェクトの venv で pysen-ls を入れて。それを vim-lsp で立ち上げないとプロジェクトに入ってる各種ツールを動かせない感じかもです。。","ts":"1619748994.300100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ocZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"21e5668b-64b4-4a5b-8168-5a8cfb28dbd2","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あー手元の方(venv)にも必要なのかも","ts":"1619748965.299700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JaF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0fc0900b-3500-4ef0-ac48-da6323a47289","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ですね pysen-ls-all が必要?","ts":"1619748869.299300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6VCmZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4920eaea-cd23-4255-bc9d-594b2c6439be","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"例えば vim-lsp-settings のように専用の venv を作って pysen-ls を入れる場合はその環境にも flake8 mypy isort black が入ってないと使えないかもしれません...。","ts":"1619748849.299000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eEIMA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7002037b-651a-46e6-ac40-2f2bd0f9aeb4","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"lsがサブのコマンドとか要求する場合のエラー通知系とかないから、むずかしいですね","ts":"1619748532.298800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k2L"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c26c10c4-ebf8-4713-a281-a01b1aa39703","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"もしかしたら pysen-ls を入れてる環境(venv等の仮想環境含む)に各種ツールが入ってないと動かないといったケースはあるかも。","ts":"1619748401.298200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iE43o"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8af4e4a1-1e1c-4f22-a746-70c7fe859dd8","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"なんかあったような...","ts":"1619748353.297900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Lov"}]},{"client_msg_id":"852BD8E4-0552-4338-912C-C336BF27BD96","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"リントも動かない感じなのですか？","ts":"1619748007.296300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kn7O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"516e7fc1-cd9b-4d16-985e-791d8478a27b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あとやっぱり自分の環境じゃ動かないなぁw\nむずいですw","ts":"1619747271.295100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"itPM+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f3c6a224-3fe1-4267-afbe-cae29c8582f9","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"black の 21 のやつ PR しよかなと思ったけど、README に PR 受け付けてないとあったので断念しました。\nまぁこれはメンテできるリソースの問題もあってしょうがなさそうです","ts":"1619747064.294600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":4,"users":["U81LLJ340","U7TMPGWJ0","UD1FQV38V","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"b7x"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d640efb9-895a-4a73-bfc8-4b87886cf9ea","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"`:LspDocumentFormat` だと `:redraw` しないと駄目かも。同期のほうの `:LspDocumentFormatSync` だとだいじょうぶっぽさ。","ts":"1619734959.292900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=OPNL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5943a152-c2c0-42c5-92f7-0c48309eb337","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"vim-lsp でも動いたことは確認しましたが pysen 自体のフォーマットの完了がめちゃくちゃ遅かったりもするので...。結構待たないとかもですね。","ts":"1619734910.292700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"PJT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b00cf2bd-7c64-45f4-9262-51f8edbd8f30","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"black が先日新しいバージョン(21.4系)がリリースされましたが pysen の black は 19.1, 20.8 系以外は弾いてるみたいですね。 21.4 系の追加したら動きました","ts":"1619733744.292500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NYLc"}]}]
